Package: aegisgate-rampart
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ca-certificates
Maintainer: AegisGate Security <security@aegisgatesecurity.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/aegisgatesecurity/aegisgate-rampart
Description: Local AI security proxy for intercepting and detecting threats
 AegisGate Rampart is a local HTTPS MITM proxy that intercepts traffic to AI
 API endpoints, runs real-time detection for PII, secrets, XSS, and compliance
 violations, and can actively block threats before they reach the AI service.
 .
 Features: 153 regex patterns, Char CNN-BiLSTM, monitor and block modes,
 system tray notifications, auto-start on boot, IDE integration, compliance
 mapping (SOC2, GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS), privacy-first (no telemetry by default).